---
// src/components/FAQ.astro
---

<section id="faq" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-2">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0b3c5d] mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-8">
      Answers to the most common questions from homeowners in Orlando and surrounding neighborhoods.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <article>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0b3c5d] mb-2">
          How much does driveway paver installation cost in Orlando?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Cost varies by driveway size, material and site preparation. We provide free estimates for Orlando and nearby cities, so you can compare design options and pricing before starting.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0b3c5d] mb-2">
          What is the best turf for Florida weather?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          We recommend premium artificial turf designed for Florida heat, humidity and heavy use. Our turf installs include a proper base and drainage to keep lawns green and durable year-round.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0b3c5d] mb-2">
          Do you install patios, walkways and driveway pavers in Orlando?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Yes. A-Plus Pavers & Grass handles full installation for patios, walkways, driveways and outdoor hardscape features across the Orlando metro area.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0b3c5d] mb-2">
          Can I get a free estimate for my project?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Absolutely. We offer free estimates for local clients in Orlando, Winter Park, Lake Nona, Kissimmee and nearby communities.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
